        "filteredHtml": "<div id=\"pop-div208431995358591721\" class=\"truste_box_overlay\"><div id=\"pop-div307806914402231001\" class=\"truste_box_overlay_inner\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Your choices regarding the use of cookies on this site\"><div class=\"truste_box_overlay_border\"></div><div id=\"pop-frame01792906829699752\" tabindex=\"1\" name=\"trustarc_cm\" class=\"trustarc_newcm_container truste_popframe\" data-no-c><div class=\"wrapper\" data-lenis-prevent=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-breakpoint-max-width-650=\"true\" data-breakpoint-max-width-730=\"true\" data-breakpoint-max-width-760=\"true\" data-breakpoint-max-width-767=\"true\" data-breakpoint-max-width-768=\"true\" data-breakpoint-max-width-780=\"true\" data-breakpoint-min-width-1=\"true\" data-breakpoint-min-width-482=\"true\" data-breakpoint-min-width-500=\"true\" data-breakpoint-min-width-632=\"true\" data-breakpoint-max-height-720=\"true\" data-breakpoint-max-height-768=\"true\"><div lang=\"en\"><div aria-labelledby=\"cookieMainHeader\" class=\"mainContent\"><div class=\"gdpr\"><div id=\"cookieMainHeader\" class=\"mainHeader consentHeader\" translate=\"no\"><h1><span>Your Privacy Choices</span></h1> <p id=\"collapse-description\"></p> <span>This site uses cookies and other online tracking technologies, including beacons and pixels (“Cookies”) to help EA websites function, improve your experience, analyze usage, and enable targeted advertising that may appear on other sites or platforms.<br><br>Depending on your location, you may have the right to opt-out of “targeted advertising,” which some privacy laws refer to as the “sharing” or “sale” of personal information. You may use the controls below to adjust your preferences with respect to targeted advertising on EA websites. If you play our PC, console, or mobile games, you have additional privacy settings available as described in our guidance on&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.ea.com/legal/privacy-portal?modal-id=targetedAdvertisingProvidedByThirdParties\" target=\"_blank\">third-party targeted advertising</a>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span> <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"readMore\" class=\"read-more-state\"> <label for=\"readMore\" class=\"read-more-trigger\"></label> <div class=\"extra-text\"> <p><br>If you clear your cookies or use a different browser or device, you will need to make these selections again. You may also manage Cookies through your browser or device settings, though this could impact the operation of this site.<br><br>These settings may also be disabled if your web browser sends an opt-out preference signal (sometimes referred to as the Global Privacy Control or \"GPC\"). Please review our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.ea.com/legal/privacy-and-cookie-policy#your-choices-and-controls\" id=\"privacyPolicyAnchor\" target=\"_blank\">Privacy and Cookie Policy</a>&nbsp;for more information.</p> </div> <div class=\"cookiecat-title\">Manage Consent</div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"prefPanel\"><div><div class=\"cookiecat\"><div tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><h2 translate=\"no\">Required Cookies</h2></div><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><p>Required Cookies are necessary for our website to operate, including delivering our content and providing security. These Cookies cannot be disabled.</p></div></div><button aria-label=\"View Required Cookies\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"viewcookie\" translate=\"no\"></button><div aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\"><br aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spacing br-clear\"></span><table class=\"prefTable optoutless\"><colgroup><col width=\"2%\"><col width=\"28%\"><col width=\"70%\"></colgroup><tbody></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><div class=\"cookiecat\"><div tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><h2 translate=\"no\">Functional Cookies</h2></div><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><p></p><p>On: Additional functions are enabled. </p> <p>Off: Additional functions that require optional Cookies are disabled. </p> <p> Functional Cookies enable additional site functionality like saving your preferences, supporting social features, and analyzing use and visits to our site. If you enable these Cookies, we may share limited data with third-parties for these purposes. If you disable them, some features and functionalities (such as social logins) may not work properly. </p><p></p></div></div><button aria-label=\"View Functional Cookies\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"viewcookie\" translate=\"no\"></button><button role=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Functional Cookies choice\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"switch\"><span aria-label=\"Off Functional Cookies\" aria-disabled=\"false\" class=\"gwt-InlineHTML on active\" translate=\"no\"><div class=\"inline-m5mrkd\"></div></span><span aria-label=\"On Functional Cookies\" aria-disabled=\"false\" class=\"gwt-InlineHTML off \" translate=\"no\"><div class=\"inline-m5mrkd\"></div></span></button><div aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"prefPanel\"><div class=\"left\"><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\">Example Purposes</span></div><div class=\"right\"><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\">On: Additional functions are enabled.</span><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\">Off: Additional functions that require optional Cookies are disabled.</span><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\">Off: Additional functions that require optional Cookies are disabled.</span></div></div><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\"><br aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spacing br-clear\"></span><table class=\"prefTable \"><colgroup><col width=\"2%\"><col width=\"28%\"><col width=\"70%\"></colgroup><tbody></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><div class=\"cookiecat\"><div tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><h2 translate=\"no\">Targeted Advertising / Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information</h2></div><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><p></p><p>On: Targeted advertising / selling or sharing of your personal information is enabled.</p> <p>Off: Targeted advertising / selling or sharing of your personal information is disabled.</p> <p> Targeted advertising Cookies are used by us and third parties to show ads that are relevant to your interests based on your visit to EA websites. If you disable advertising cookies, you may still see ads, but they will not be tailored to your interests based on your visit to EA websites. </p><p></p></div></div><button aria-label=\"View Targeted Advertising / Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"viewcookie\" translate=\"no\"></button><button role=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Targeted Advertising / Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information choice\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"switch\"><span aria-label=\"Off Targeted Advertising / Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\" aria-disabled=\"false\" class=\"gwt-InlineHTML on active\" translate=\"no\"><div class=\"inline-m5mrkd\"></div></span><span aria-label=\"On Targeted Advertising / Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\" aria-disabled=\"false\" class=\"gwt-InlineHTML off \" translate=\"no\"><div class=\"inline-m5mrkd\"></div></span></button><div aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"prefPanel\"><div class=\"left\"><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\">Example Purposes</span></div><div class=\"right\"><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\">On: Targeted advertising / selling or sharing of your personal information is enabled.</span><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\">Off: Targeted advertising / selling or sharing of your personal information is disabled.</span><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\">Off: Targeted advertising / selling or sharing of your personal information is disabled.</span></div></div><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\"><br aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spacing br-clear\"></span><table class=\"prefTable \"><colgroup><col width=\"2%\"><col width=\"28%\"><col width=\"70%\"></colgroup><tbody></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"truste-anti-vppa1\"><b>IMPORTANT:</b> If you wish to withdraw your consent to share and record your website activity (including game browsing, video viewing, and purchase history) with Electronic Arts’ third-party partners, switch this setting to OFF.</div></div><div><div class=\"cookiecat\"><div tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><h2 translate=\"no\">Multimedia Player</h2></div><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><p></p><p>On: Watching video content hosted by our partners (e.g., YouTube) is enabled.</p> <p>Off: Watching video content hosted by our partners (e.g., YouTube) is disabled.</p> <p> Watching video content hosted by our partners may involve their use of Cookies for advertising and functional/analytics purposes.</p><p></p></div></div><button aria-label=\"View Multimedia Player\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"viewcookie\" translate=\"no\"></button><button role=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Multimedia Player choice\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"switch\"><span aria-label=\"Off Multimedia Player\" aria-disabled=\"false\" class=\"gwt-InlineHTML on active\" translate=\"no\"><div class=\"inline-m5mrkd\"></div></span><span aria-label=\"On Multimedia Player\" aria-disabled=\"false\" class=\"gwt-InlineHTML off \" translate=\"no\"><div class=\"inline-m5mrkd\"></div></span></button><div aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"prefPanel\"><div class=\"left\"><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\">Example Purposes</span></div><div class=\"right\"><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\">On: Watching video content hosted by our partners (e.g., YouTube) is enabled.</span><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\">Off: Watching video content hosted by our partners (e.g., YouTube) is disabled.</span><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\">Off: Watching video content hosted by our partners (e.g., YouTube) is disabled.</span></div></div><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\"><br aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spacing br-clear\"></span><table class=\"prefTable \"><colgroup><col width=\"2%\"><col width=\"28%\"><col width=\"70%\"></colgroup><tbody></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class=\"pdynamicbutton\"><div></div><button class=\"submit\" translate=\"no\">Submit Preferences</button><button class=\"declineAllButtonLower\" translate=\"no\">Decline All</button><button class=\"acceptAllButtonLower\" translate=\"no\">Accept All</button></div></div></div><div class=\"footer\"><div class=\"left\" translate=\"no\"><a id=\"privacyPolicyAnchor\" href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">Privacy Policy</a></div><div class=\"right\" translate=\"no\">Powered by: <a href=\"http://trustarc.com/\" target=\"_blank\"></a></div><br class=\"spacing\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"closebtn-id0.45103568009690764\" class=\"truste-close-button-container\"><a aria-label=\"close\" role=\"button\" class=\"truste-close-button\" tabindex=\"1\" id=\"trustarc-internal-close-button\"></a></div></div></div>",
